# The OpenDrone shared parts catalogue: 145 footprints, 110 symbols,
# 246 3D models and 48 datasheets, ~290 MB. Not vendored -- clone it:
#
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/OpenDrone-hw/KiCad-Library.git pcb/DrikrAIO/hardware/KiCad-Library
#
# fp-lib-table and sym-lib-table resolve OpenDrone, 4in1ESC, OpenRX-Shared
# and ESCLibrary through it. Without it the schematics still open, because
# symbols are embedded, but footprints will not resolve for layout.
KiCad-Library/

# KiCad local state, per-user
*.kicad_prl
fp-info-cache
*-backups/

# generated reports and locks
erc.rpt
drc.rpt
*.net
~*.lck
